ht:18px;\n  text-align:right;\n}\n.run-photo{\n  left:858px; top:617px;\n  width:388px; height:262px;\n}\n.run-caption{\n  position:absolute;\n  left:858px; top:890px;\n  width:210px;\n  font-size:12px;\n  line-height:18px;\n  text-align:left;\n}\n\n.shadow-photo{\n  left:858px; top:960px;\n  width:388px; height:516px;\n}\n.shadow-caption{\n  position:absolute;\n  left:858px; top:1494px;\n  width:258px;\n  font-size:13px;\n  line-height:18px;\n}\n.crowd-photo{\n  left:858px; top:1583px;\n  width:388px; height:262px;\n}\n.crowd-caption{\n  position:absolute;\n  left:858px; top:1855px;\n  width:240px;\n  font-size:12px;\n  line-height:18px;\n  text-align:center;\n}\n\n.choir-photo{\n  left:120px; top:1107px;\n  width:378px; height:252px;\n}\n.letter-photo{\n  left:120px; top:1398px;\n  width:378px; height:252px;\n}\n.tug-photo{\n  left:120px; top:1690px;\n  width:378px; height:207px;\n}\n.left-caption{\n  position:absolute;\n  left:19px;\n  width:91px;\n  font-size:13px;\n  line-height:18px;\n  text-align:right;\n}\n.cap-choir{top:1201px}\n.cap-letter{top:1493px}\n.cap-tug{top:1772px}\n\n.article{\n  position:absolute;\n  left:545px; top:1106px;\n  width:267px;\n  font-family:\"SimSun\",\"Songti SC\",serif;\n  font-size:12.5px;\n  line-height:17px;\n  text-align:justify;\n  text-justify:inter-ideograph;\n}\n.article p{\n  margin:0;\n  text-indent:2em;\n}\n.article p:first-child{text-indent:0}\n.credits{\n  position:absolute;\n  left:650px; top:1725px;\n  width:160px;\n  text-align:right;\n  font-size:15px;\n  white-space:nowrap;\n}\n.qr{\n  position:absolute;\n  left:582px; top:1818px;\n  width:93px; height:93px;\n  border:1px solid #999;\n  display:flex;\n  align-items:center;\n  justify-content:center;\n  color:#444;\n  font-size:11px;\n  line-height:15px;\n  text-align:center;\n  background:\n    repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#222 0 2px,#fff 2px 4px),\n    repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg,transparent 0 3px,#222 3px 5px);\n}\n.qr span{background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);padding:3px}\n.qr-copy{\n  position:absolute;\n  left:698px; top:1828px;\n  width:110px;\n  font-size:13px;\n  line-height:20px;\n}\n.footer{\n  position:absolute;\n  left:8px; bottom:8px;\n  width:1250px;\n  height:29px;\n  border-top:1px solid #555;\n  padding:8px 11px 0;\n  font-size:11px;\n  white-space:nowrap;\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"page\">\n  <header class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"page-number\">4</div>\n    <div class=\"section-name\">求是苑·剪影</div>\n    <div class=\"header-separator\"></div>\n    <div class=\"header-info\">\n      <div>2018年9月14日　星期五</div>\n      <div>责任编辑:张岚　联系电话:(0571-88981339</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"logo\">浙江大学报<small>ZHE JIANG DA XUE BAO</small></div>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"top-caption tc1\">汗水流过坚毅的脸庞<br>陈佳轩&nbsp;&nbsp;摄</div>\n  <div class=\"top-caption tc2\">挥旗<br>施良辰&nbsp;&nbsp;摄</div>\n  <div class=\"top-caption tc3\">别担心,我不累<br>梁汉卿&nbsp;&nbsp;摄</div>\n  <div class=\"top-caption tc4\">关怀<br>何念泽&nbsp;&nbsp;摄</div>\n\n  <div class=\"placeholder top-photo tp1 photo-top-1\"><span>[照片：军训面孔]</span></div>\n  <div class=\"placeholder top-photo tp2 photo-top-2\"><span>[照片：挥旗]</span></div>\n  <div class=\"placeholder top-photo tp3 photo-top-3\"><span>[照片：军训学员]</span></div>\n  <div class=\"placeholder top-photo tp4 photo-top-4\"><span>[照片：训练关怀]</span></div>\n\n  <section class=\"title-block\">\n    <h1>在军训中磨砺青春</h1>\n    <p>——浙江大学2018年学生军训掠影</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"placeholder main-photo photo-main\"><span>[照片：军训队列]</span></div>\n  <div class=\"main-caption\">在校园的每个角落练习着<br>军姿<br>陈佳轩&nbsp;&nbsp;摄</div>\n\n  <div class=\"placeholder run-photo photo-run\"><span>[照片：定向越野]</span></div>\n  <div class=\"run-caption\">在定向越野中奋力奔跑<br>陈佳轩&nbsp;&nbsp;摄</div>\n\n  <div class=\"placeholder shadow-photo photo-shadow\"><span>[照片：列队遮挡烈日]</span></div>\n  <div class=\"shadow-caption\">一排男生站成一列，用<br>自己的影子给姑娘挡住烈日</div>\n\n  <div class=\"placeholder crowd-photo photo-crowd\"><span>[照片：迷彩方阵]</span></div>\n  <div class=\"crowd-caption\">迷彩的颜色是今夏紫金<br>港最靓丽的风景线<br>陈佳轩&nbsp;&nbsp;摄</div>\n\n  <div class=\"left-caption cap-choir\">用一场合唱<br>比赛铭记这些闪<br>亮的日子<br>胡琪宣&nbsp;&nbsp;摄</div>\n  <div class=\"placeholder choir-photo photo-choir\"><span>[照片：军训合唱]</span></div>\n\n  <div class=\"left-caption cap-letter\">用一份入党<br>申请书见证理想<br>与信念<br>胡琪宣&nbsp;&nbsp;摄</div>\n  <div class=\"placeholder letter-photo photo-letter\"><span>[照片：书写申请书]</span></div>\n\n  <div class=\"left-caption cap-tug\">用一场拔河<br>比赛演绎青春的<br>力量<br>陈佳轩&nbsp;&nbsp;摄</div>\n  <div class=\"placeholder tug-photo photo-tug\"><span>[照片：拔河比赛]</span></div>\n\n  <article class=\"article\">\n    <p>紫金港，你五点钟的晨曦真美。</p>\n    <p>见过早晨五点钟的校园吗？柔亮的光里忽地划出几声嘹亮的口号，然后映出大团的绿，不同于大自然肆意的绿色，那是一种属于军人的——规矩的绿！军装整齐、步伐一致、口号嘹亮，浙大的新人们迎来了他们军训的一天。</p>\n    <p>谁言书生只善文，军训场上显神威！既怀得鲲鹏之志，岂能无钢铁之躯？壮志凌云，跃跃欲试；意气风发，摩拳擦掌。能文善武，成大国之器；握笔挥刀，铸全能之材！</p>\n    <p>紫金港，你日光下汗浸衣襟的战士们真帅。</p>\n    <p>“向左转！向右转！”“齐步走！”一遍两遍，百遍千遍。不娇不惰，不偏不倚。浙大人不怕苦，浙大人要磨炼钢铁意志！心中有理想，脚下有力量。日光坚定，我们向往成功钢铁一般的战士，故我们忍耐，我们奋发，至刚至坚，长空亮剑，气贯云天！</p>\n    <p>烈日炎炎，熔不了心中激情；汗水涔涔，带不走崇高信念。青春年华，用汗水诠释；前路漫漫，用血泪征服！</p>\n    <p>宣父犹能畏后生，丈夫未可轻年少！不屈——不屈——！</p>\n    <p>紫金港，你夕阳里的辅导员真好看。</p>\n    <p>屈原道：“路漫漫其修远兮，吾将上下而求索。”竺老校长三问犹然在耳，唯有向前，全力以赴，才可不负重托。前人栽树，岂若同众多浙大的学长学姐一起，为我们守护着这方生机盎然的土地。战火中的西迁故事，林俊德院士的事迹……既传达了力量，更是我们时刻铭记！传承的重任在肩，要传承的是一代代浙大人艰苦创业的精神，要传承的是一代代浙大人求是创新的灵魂！</p>\n    <p>紫金港，你路灯下的湖水轻轻泛起涟漪，你黑暗中的荷枝柔柔地扭动腰肢，你月牙楼边传来的歌声微微回响。</p>\n    <p>这一天末了，战士们都进入梦乡。</p>\n    <p>紫金港，你今天真好看。我想，明天的你一定更加美丽！</p>\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"credits\">本版文字&nbsp;&nbsp;包容&nbsp;&nbsp;杨萝萝</div>\n\n  <div class=\"qr\"><span>[二维码]</span></div>\n  <div class=\"qr-copy\">用手机QQ<br>扫一扫二维码<br>加入浙江大学<br>QQ智慧校园</div>\n\n  <footer class=\"footer\">\n    本报通讯地址:浙江大学紫金港校区东三105　《浙江大学报》编辑部　邮编:310058　电子信箱:zdxb@zju.edu.cn　电话:0571-88981339　88273707　总编:应飚　副总编:章旻　电子编辑:李岑　承印:新华通讯社浙江分社印刷厂\n  </footer>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>"
